Description: BizFlow POS – Desktop Point of Sale for Retail / Supermarket
 BizFlow POS is a feature-rich, offline-capable desktop Point of Sale
 system designed for retail shops and supermarkets. It provides:
  * Sales and receipt management with barcode scanning support
  * Inventory and product catalogue management
  * Role-based staff logins with BCrypt-secured passwords
  * Daily / weekly / monthly sales reports exported as PDF or Excel
  * Optional live sync to the Mobile Meals Center cloud API
  * SQLite local database — no server setup required
 .
 Requires Java 21 or later (OpenJDK 21 recommended).
